									<div data-panel="{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;PanelGroup&quot;}" id="aboutThisGame" class="game_page_autocollapse" style="max-height: 850px;">
						<div id="game_area_description" class="game_area_description">
							<h2>About This Game</h2>
							<h2 class="bb_tag" >🌱Grow Your Crops</h2>Unlock new crops as your farm grows, each with its own growth time and price. Some pay fast, some pay big.<br><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5025010/extras/a22fff5b3fea2429dc0994d2fa7a6d07.poster.avif?t=1793648053" width=1170 height=370 ><source src="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5025010/extras/a22fff5b3fea2429dc0994d2fa7a6d07.webm?t=1793648053" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5025010/extras/a22fff5b3fea2429dc0994d2fa7a6d07.mp4?t=1793648053" type="video/mp4"></video></span><h2 class="bb_tag" >💰 Sell in Your Farm Shop</h2>Everything you grow lands on your shelves, and every sale brings the next upgrade a little closer.<br><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5025010/extras/19eea76c809db2c534751507d1baaa8e.poster.avif?t=1793648053" width=1170 height=390 ><source src="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5025010/extras/19eea76c809db2c534751507d1baaa8e.webm?t=1793648053" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5025010/extras/19eea76c809db2c534751507d1baaa8e.mp4?t=1793648053" type="video/mp4"></video></span><h2 class="bb_tag" >🛠️ Reinvest and Upgrade</h2>Better tools, faster growth, bigger yields. There's always a next upgrade on the horizon.<br><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5025010/extras/9b6fa66038af667be721bd4702f9fece.poster.avif?t=1793648053" width=1170 height=390 ><source src="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5025010/extras/9b6fa66038af667be721bd4702f9fece.webm?t=1793648053" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5025010/extras/9b6fa66038af667be721bd4702f9fece.mp4?t=1793648053" type="video/mp4"></video></span><h2 class="bb_tag" >🗺️ Expand Your Land</h2>When the money comes in, the fences move out. Buy new fields and watch your farm grow far beyond that first little plot.<br><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5025010/extras/0bbf26d1e6846371f2c0aca5f4dfb755.poster.avif?t=1793648053" width=1170 height=390 ><source src="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5025010/extras/0bbf26d1e6846371f2c0aca5f4dfb755.webm?t=1793648053" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5025010/extras/0bbf26d1e6846371f2c0aca5f4dfb755.mp4?t=1793648053" type="video/mp4"></video></span><h2 class="bb_tag" >☕ Relax, It'll Grow</h2>Ten minutes or a whole afternoon, the farm is always happy to see you. No pressure, ever.<br><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5025010/extras/333e8e3dd5b20bc7a18b5aaacd13b962.poster.avif?t=1793648053" width=1170 height=370 ><source src="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5025010/extras/333e8e3dd5b20bc7a18b5aaacd13b962.webm?t=1793648053" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5025010/extras/333e8e3dd5b20bc7a18b5aaacd13b962.mp4?t=1793648053" type="video/mp4"></video></span><h2 class="bb_tag" >Features</h2><ul class="bb_ul"><li>🌱Grow Your Crops</li><li>💰 Sell in Your Farm Shop</li><li>🛠️ Reinvest and Upgrade</li><li>🗺️ Expand Your Land</li><li>☕ Relax, It'll Grow</li></ul>						</div>
					</div>
